   "body": "**Operator decision 2026-11-06 ~15:25 UTC:** the AQ create capture is **approved**: one real public AQ posted on `aq.super-h.fr`.\n- The Mac capture session (`mac/m2-lead`) asks the operator for the topic, the message and the pseudo before sending, and logs the write here (AGENTS §8).\n- Scope as in the body: 1) a successful create; 2) one refusal if the operator agrees; 3) the `getAlertesByTopic.php` re-read. Cookie-less, no redirect followed, anonymized per FIXTURES.\n- When it lands, LOT-055 (#81) gets the create in a follow-up PR (Opus → Fable).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
